          "fresh_walking_jump_40": "Hold right, release B; release A1frame then hold A40frames. Start a full walking jump from a visible solid surface to clear a tall obstacle with less horizontal travel. Cannot start a new jump while airborne.",
          "run_forward_4": "Hold right+B, release A, 4frames. Advance on clear ground, descend toward landing, or release A so a fresh jump can follow.",
          "run_forward_8": "Hold right+B, release A, 8frames. Advance along safe ground or descend to land before initiating another jump.",
